# The client names a SavedVariables file after the addon folder that declares it, never after the
# variable, so anything the player stored would land in Spoken.lua beside its settings. This folder
# exists so the file a player is told to upload is named for what it holds. Gather.lua in the
# player reads and writes the table. Sent.lua is the Spoken Manager's: outside SavedVariables,
# because the game overwrites those from memory at every logout.
Sent.lua
